Documentation     [SUITE PURPOSE]   CB009890-Test-Template-Common-Keywords
...               Prerequisite :
...               Scope :
...               Test Case Scenario author   : christophe.samson@nokia.com
...               Creation Date               : 04-12-2023
...               Modified Date               : 04-12-2023
...               Last Modified by            : christophe.samson@nokia.com
...               Version   Date          Author                                   Notes
